<title>SOUTH KOREA: Gas blast kills 12, injures 14 in Seoul.</title>
<headline>Gas blast kills 12, injures 14 in Seoul.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1996-09-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>A gas explosion at a restaurant in Seoul killed 12 people and injured 14 on Sunday, state television reported.</p>
<p>It said the blast occurred at 10.45 p.m. at a cafe called the Rolling Stone in central Seoul. No further details were immediately available.</p>
</text>
